comment "HiSilicon media platform drivers"

config VIDEO_HISTB_VPSS
	tristate "HiSilicon Hi3798CV200 video post-processing engine"
	depends on ARCH_HISI || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on HAS_DMA && OF
	help
	  Support the VPSS engine used to convert native CV200 decoder tile
	  surfaces into linear video frames. The engine is consumed by other
	  media drivers and does not expose a userspace node of its own.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here. The module will be
	  called histb-vpss.
